# Look families, materials and working names for the piece catalog.
# A look family groups pieces that read as one set in the game: the same texture sheet, tint and finish, checked on
# the icon and texture contact sheets (research/2026-11-12-catalog in the private repo). The rules below match the
# piece's main texture first (shared texture = shared look), then a few id series where one texture sheet carries two
# looks (the Deep North timber pieces use the dark wood sheet's light boards; see FAMILY_BY_ID).
